Scope of this licence

The MIT licence above covers SV1BTL's own work in this package: the UberSDR
adaptation and extras in websdr_sv1btl/sv1btl/ubersdr-compat.js, station.js,
install.sh, uninstall.sh, check-after-update.sh, README.md and SV1BTL's
changes to the page files.

Third-party parts keep their own terms and are NOT relicensed:

  - WebSDR client pages and scripts (websdr-base.js, the mobile page):
    (c) 2007-2014 Pieter-Tjerk de Boer, PA3FWM, www.websdr.org
  - Layout, styles and waterfall colour map: RW3PS's WebSDR template
  - websdr-nr.js noise reduction: (c) 2026 joshuah.rainstar@gmail.com, MIT
    terms with a caveat on commercial use, see the header of that file
    (SV1BTL's residual-floor change to it is under the same terms)
  - sv1btl/cw-decoder.js CW decoder: from PhantomSDR-Plus
    (github.com/sv1btl/PhantomSDR-Plus), GNU General Public License v3
  - sv1btl/psdr/ (FT8/FT4/FT2/JS8/WSPR/SSTV/FAX/NAVTEX/RTTY/PSK31/Olivia/MFSK
    decoders; mfsk.js is a port of fldigi's IZ8BLY MFSK receiver) and
    sv1btl/decoders.js: from PhantomSDR-Plus, GNU General Public License v3;
    inside them ft8_lib.wasm (ft8_lib by Karlis Goba, MIT), js8.wasm (built
    on ft8_lib with tables from JS8Call) and js8_dict.bin (JS8Call, GPL v3)
